      dealing: 'Each player receives 6 cards in batches of 3. No card is turned for trump.',
    },
    turnFlow: "1. The player to dealer's left pitches the first card; its suit becomes trump. 2. The first trick is kept face up with a trump visible on top; later tricks are face down. 3. If a player has no trumps and no counting cards above 9 and is not winning the current trick, they may throw in their hand and take no further part while partner continues. 4. Score points in order High, Low, Jack, Game.",
